    "answer": {
      "short": "One solution is $((6+6)-(6\\div6))\\times6=66$.",
      "worked": "One solution is:\n$$\\begin{align*}((6+6)-(6\\div6))\\times6&=(12-1)\\times6\\\\((6+6)-(6\\div6))\\times6&=11\\times6\\\\((6+6)-(6\\div6))\\times6&=66\\end{align*}$$\nThis uses exactly five 6s. Evaluate inside the brackets before multiplying.",
